    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2LhEe24oay53RyeYRYN5ytz)_\n\n## Cause\n- `ibuffer-saved-filter-groups` only stores groups. Nothing called `ibuffer-switch-to-saved-filter-groups`, so the list was never sectioned.\n- `nerd-icons-ibuffer-mode` (enabled in `sp-icons`) overwrites `ibuffer-formats` with `nerd-icons-ibuffer-formats`, so the custom column widths were never used.\n\n## Fix\n- `sp-buffers-activate-filter-groups` runs on `ibuffer-mode-hook` and switches to the \"Main\" groups.\n- Column widths: name 36 (24 in the compact format), mode 18, `:elide` for long text, file path takes the remaining width.\n- The same widths are set for `nerd-icons-ibuffer-formats` after that package loads, keeping the icon column.\n- Same change in `docs/tangles/ui/sp-buffers.org`, with bullets.\n\n## Not tested\n- No Emacs in the cloud container; only checked that the parentheses balance. Please open `C-x C-b` once to confirm.\n- Branch is not number-prefixed (the branch is fixed by the environment); no `CHANGELOG.org` edit.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD37BuLaMwPUpatw23)_",
